    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord for Our Future Testing!</h1><p><br>After years of dedication and passion, we have poured our hearts into our latest creation, Chrono Hunter. We strive to bring the VR community the ultimate roguelike experience with our sincere offering. We hope this endeavor will become a flagship Rogue title in the realm of VR gaming.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>As a time traveler agent equipped with VR physical controls<br>You'll embark on a captivating journey through diverse and meticulously crafted levels<br>Unleash your arsenal of unique abilities as you navigate through challenges<br>From manipulating time to harnessing special powers<br>You'll need to adapt and strategize to overcome the obstacles that lie in your path<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8db3b51c9d680f624d6910eebcffa6e2.webp?t=1747212314\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/72200c7eca72923f61cfa4be00044a72.webp?t=1747212314\" /></div><br>Make wise decisions as you navigate challenging levels, carefully utilizing your special abilities and power-ups <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/c7fb07961fe54efd25b11c4afec21ed4.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/c7fb07961fe54efd25b11c4afec21ed4.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/c7fb07961fe54efd25b11c4afec21ed4.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dive into a world where every action feels intuitive, natural and FUN<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/995aad02beb01fb97dc3c239e943c8d2.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/995aad02beb01fb97dc3c239e943c8d2.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/995aad02beb01fb97dc3c239e943c8d2.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Immerse yourself in stunning environments that are meticulously crafted with attention to detail<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8b4cbdf8e6e11504985d79885763cc7b.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8b4cbdf8e6e11504985d79885763cc7b.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/8b4cbdf8e6e11504985d79885763cc7b.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Progress through each run to discover new and powerful enhancements<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/b6705e768e81adb6dff945de75bb524f.poster.avif?t=1747212314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/b6705e768e81adb6dff945de75bb524f.webm?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092670/extras/b6705e768e81adb6dff945de75bb524f.mp4?t=1747212314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
